      ]
    },
    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- Open index.html to view the options list, pick button, counter, and recent picks area.\r\n- Edit the items in the \"Your Options\" list directly to add or change choices.\r\n- Click the \"Pick One!\" button to select a random item from your list.\r\n- Observe the \"Times Picked\" counter update after each selection.\r\n- Watch the \"Recent Picks\" area to see the items you have chosen recently.",
